OL,3,AWhite House lifts tariffs on some
OL,4,ACanadian goods as midterm elections
OL,5,Aloom
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Trump administration is lifting
OL,8,Fsome of its 50% tariffs on Canadian
OL,9,Fgoods two weeks before the midterm
OL,10,Felections, after a Republican candidate
OL,11,Fin a key US Senate race said she had
OL,12,Flobbied for the change.
OL,14,FFrom 30 October, tariffs will be eased
OL,15,Fon products including "plywood sheets,
OL,16,Fsome paper products, certain machinery
OL,17,Fand refrigeration equipment", the White
OL,18,FHouse said on Friday.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
